{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Roguelike&quot; redefined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rogue combines classic turn based RPG goodness with action based combat, creating a hybrid RPG experience. Quickly cut through your foes, or slow down and tackle groups of enemies with spells and potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect mystery items and gear, identify with scrolls of identification in classic style, then build, buff, and bolster your character for success.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character classes are defined dynamically by play style, inventory use and composition, and equipped gear, giving players a different experience every run. The Rogue's class defines his stat growth, Body and Brain. Over 15 classes available include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue, Thief, Chef, Scholar, Paladin, Warlock, Legend, and the elusive Assassin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three game modes include classic play with permadeath, casual mode for the less experienced players, and omega mode for a post game romp through billions of dungeons where 10 unique bosses hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboards track and compare classic game completions and slayers of the omega bosses for a competitive touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Internet connection required to play.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Dreamer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4110600/e33fbb035530935128ddf37013c2b067ca142cfd.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4110600/a78024f8b122c42407a07cc5eb87b57095527a80.jpg"},{"name":"Studious","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4110600/96e6ade979a87f14cd6b8a0a287df2d277807a8d.jpg"},{"name":"Packrat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4110600/8bfd87ed577ac59de56ca7f75eaa19d16b805d4e.jpg"},{"name":"Voidwalker","path"