w down and tackle groups of enemies with spells and potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect mystery items and gear, identify with scrolls of identification in classic style, then build, buff, and bolster your character for success.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character classes are defined dynamically by play style, inventory use and composition, and equipped gear, giving players a different experience every run. The Rogue's class defines his stat growth, Body and Brain. Over 15 classes available include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue, Thief, Chef, Scholar, Paladin, Warlock, Legend, and the elusive Assassin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three game modes include classic play with permadeath, casual mode for the less experienced players, and omega mode for a post game romp through billions of dungeons where 10 unique bosses hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboards track and compare classic game completions and slayers of the omega bosses for a competitive touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Internet connection required to play.</p>","developers":["SevenTwo7"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110600/eb3228243471ea11491646dba5229160aed568ae/header.jpg?t=1764699684","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4110600/1277910965/3eb44a4aa487a11049ca974c0d848213c84e697c/1761517460/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761843011","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4110600/1277910965/3eb44a4aa487a11049ca974c0d848213c84e697c/1761517460/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761843011","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4110600/1277910965/3eb44a4aa487a11049ca974c0d848213c84e697c/1761517460/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761843011","id":257222818,"name":"userAccessible","thumbnail":"https://shared.akam